<title>POLAND: KABLE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>KABLE NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.77 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.08 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.85 vs   0.64</p>
<p> Sales		   12.48 vs  12.47</p>
